  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Parliamentary Processes in Jordan (SPPJ)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to strengthen parliamentary processes and supports political modernisation through workshops and dialogues that promote policy-driven party development and citizen engagement. It will also inform possible approaches to enhance Parliament&#x2019;s role as a space for public debate, building trust in democratic institutions and informing future scalable reforms.</narrative>
  </description>
